# RSSHub secrets — copy to infra/rsshub.env then edit.
# (rsshub.env is .gitignored.)
#
# How to get each:

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# ZHIHU_COOKIES — needed for /zhihu/people/* and most zhihu routes.
# Without it RSSHub gets the same 403 from Zhihu's anti-bot that we did.
#
# How to grab:
#   1. Open https://www.zhihu.com/ logged in
#   2. DevTools → Network → click any request to www.zhihu.com or zhuanlan.zhihu.com
#   3. Request Headers → Cookie: line → entire string copied
#   4. Paste below (no quotes around the value, no `=` escaping)
#
# Validity: typically months. Re-grab if zhihu sources start 401/403'ing.
ZHIHU_COOKIES=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# TWITTER_AUTH_TOKEN — needed for /twitter/* (X) routes since 2023.
# Optional; leave blank if you don't activate any X sources.
#
# How to grab:
#   1. https://x.com logged in
#   2. DevTools → Application → Cookies → x.com → row "auth_token"
#   3. Copy the value (just the token, ~40 hex chars)
TWITTER_AUTH_TOKEN=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional gate: if set, RSSHub requires `?key=<value>` on every request.
# Useful if you expose port 1200 to the internet. For localhost-only, leave blank.
ACCESS_KEY=
